ing gear - you're joining a community dedicated to creating extraordinary moments.<\/p>","enlarge_text":false,"enlarge_new_text":false,"text_size":"h6","text_color":""}}},"block_order":["header_image_zQRVEE","heading_gGnTER","text_xpQVWz"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"link_id":"","full_screen":false,"max_content_width":"","rounded_design":false,"media_rounded_size":"40","grid_layout":false,"angle_size":"","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":20,"layout":"right","image_fit":"contain","media_width":40,"media_scale":81,"title_weight":false,"title_uppercase":false,"heading":"","heading_size":"h2","header_text":"","enlarge_text":true,"text_size":"p","header_text_position":"justify-center","text_align":"text-start","show_text_color":false,"set_text_color":"","full_screen_bg":"#f9f9f9","color_scheme":"none","only_content_color_scheme":false,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Sponsorship-1-02-1206.jpg","img_url":"","img_alt":"Why empower the grilling community?","video_external":"","video_description":"","video_autoplay":false}},"use_image_banner_RAftjH":{"type":"use-image-banner","blocks":{"heading_Amyw3K":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Discover the Benefits of Collaborating with Us","display_one_line_for_text":false,"header_description":"","show_header_color":false,"set_header_color":"","show_text_glow":false,"show_text_gradient":false,"title_one_color":"","title_one_color_size":"","title_two_color":"","title_two_color_size":"","title_three_color":"","title_three_color_size":"","title_four_color":"","title_four_color_size":"","title_color_angle":"45","heading_size":"h3","add_class_name":false,"use_class_name":"","header_weight":true,"header_uppercase":true,"heading_h1":false,"mobile_one_color":"#2a2a2a"}},"tab_one_GQDhCX":{"type":"tab-one","settings":{"enable_media":true,"tab_layout":"carousel","tab_column_size":"medium","tab_column_align":"left","tab_box_image_one":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/600x411-0327.jpg","image_title_one":"Monument Grills Sizzles at the  2025 National Hardware Show","image_description_one":"<p>From March 18-20, Monument Grills participated in the 2025 National Hardware Show in Las Vegas, showcasing outstanding performance in the show's Celebrity Chef Cook-Off. Our gas grills impressed with their durability, precision, and exceptional grilling power.<\/p>","tab_box_image_two":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Sponsorship-2es-2-1206.jpg","image_title_two":"Marketing Support","image_description_two":"<p>We’ll help amplify your event’s reach through strategic marketing efforts—before, during, and after. This includes co-branded campaigns, media outreach, and ongoing promotion to boost brand visibility, engage your audience, and drive greater participation.<\/p>","tab_box_image_three":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Sponsorship-2es-3-1206.jpg","image_title_three":"Branded Merchandise and Giveaways","image_description_three":"<p>Enhance attendee engagement with Monument Grills-branded products, giveaways, and swag, creating excitement and offering memorable takeaways that align with our premium grilling experience.<\/p>"}},"tab_two_NeVWwF":{"type":"tab-two","settings":{"tab_layout":"grid","icon_one":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Sponsorship-2ip-1-1206.jpg","icon_title_one":"Free Products and Accessories","icon_description_one":"<p>Receive our premium grills and accessories to showcase in your content, helping you create authentic and engaging content for your audience.<\/p>","icon_two":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Sponsorship-2ip-2-1206.jpg","icon_title_two":"Paid Collaborations","icon_description_two":"<p>Enjoy competitive compensation for your partnership, with opportunities to participate in sponsored posts, product reviews, and dedicated campaigns.<\/p>","icon_three":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Sponsorship-2ip-3-1206.jpg","icon_title_three":"Join Our Affiliate Program","icon_description_three":"<p>Earn sales commissions by joining our affiliate program, allowing you to generate ongoing income while promoting products you love.<\/p>","icon_four":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Sponsorship-2ip-4-1206.jpg","icon_title_four":"Exclusive Content Promotion","icon_description_four":"<p>We’ll amplify your content across our community, including social media, website features, email campaigns, and targeted advertising, giving your content increased exposure.<\/p>","icon_five":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Sponsorship-2ip-5-1206.jpg","icon_title_five":"Become a Brand Ambassador","icon_description_five":"<p>Join us as a long-term Monument Grills ambassador and enjoy continuous partnership benefits, including custom-branded gifts, early access to product launches, and exclusive testing opportunities for new products.<\/p>","icon_six":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Sponsorship-2ip-6-1206.jpg","icon_title_six":"VIP Access to Events","icon_description_six":"<p>Receive special invitations to attend our events as a VIP guest, providing you with opportunities to connect with our team and fans in a more personal setting.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["heading_Amyw3K","tab_one_GQDhCX","tab_two_NeVWwF"],"settings":{"link_id":"","full_screen":true,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"show_tab":true,"tabbar_title_one":"For Organizations","tabbar_title_two":"For Creators","tabbar_title_three":"","tabbar_title_color":"#cecece","tabbar_title_hover_color":"#ffffff","tabbar_title_active_color":"#c00000","image_desktop":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Sponsorship-2-1206.jpg","url":"","height_mode":"auto","fixed_height_desktop":600,"fixed_height_mobile":350,"overlay_position":"justify-center items-center","info_max_width":70,"position_right":60,"overlay_text_align":"text-center","mob_center_text":false,"mobile_stacked":false,"text_bg":false,"mobile_position":false,"mobile_overlay_position":"mobile-top-center","color_scheme":"white","full_width":true,"transparent_content_color":"#ffffff","tint_color":"#000000","tint_opacity":0,"prevent_animation":false,"use_background_box":false,"background_box_bg":"","background_box_text_color":"","top_offset_position":10,"background_box_position":"top_center","show_gradient_font_offset_position":false,"gradient_font_offset_position":10}},"faq_iyjizD":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"question_N9aifj":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Do you offer financial compensation for collaborations?","text":"<p>Compensation is evaluated on a case-by-case basis, depending on the scope and mutual benefits.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_hk6TMx":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"What types of events or organizations does Monument Grills sponsor?","text":"<p>We sponsor a wide range of events and organizations, including grilling competitions, community gatherings, farmers' markets, and other activities aligned with outdoor living and community engagement.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_kwQ4rJ":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"How long does the sponsorship approval process take?","text":"<p>Typically, we review proposals within 2-3 weeks and notify selected applicants promptly.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_ytPPxG":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"What are the criteria for sponsorship selection?","text":"<p>Proposals are evaluated based on alignment with our brand values, audience reach, and potential impact.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_b4jqFr":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Can we request multiple sponsorships for different events?","text":"<p>Yes, but each event requires a separate application for evaluation.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_XGEUCa":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"What kind of support can we expect?","text":"<p>Depending on the proposal, support may include products, discounts, financial assistance, or co-promotion.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_VgXLg3":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Who qualifies as a creator for sponsorship?","text":"<p>Bloggers, influencers, and content creators across various fields, including food, lifestyle, outdoor activities, home improvement, and family-oriented content.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_PbYeH6":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Do I need a specific number of followers to apply?","text":"<p>There’s no minimum, but we prioritize creators with an engaged audience and high-quality content.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_UxQrfw":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"What type of collaboration can I expect?","text":"<p>Collaborations may include product reviews, giveaways, exclusive content, or long-term partnerships.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_EU9ndY":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Can I use the sponsored product for multiple posts?","text":"<p>Absolutely! We encourage authentic and creative use of our products in your content.<\/p>","read_number":0}}},"block_order":["question_N9aifj","question_hk6TMx","question_kwQ4rJ","question_ytPPxG","question_b4jqFr","question_XGEUCa","question_VgXLg3","question_PbYeH6","question_UxQrfw","question_EU9ndY"],"settings":{"heading":"FAQs","heading_align":"text-center","color_scheme":"none","full_width":true}},"media_grid_bREKin":{"type":"media-grid","blocks":{"media_LV8GpG":{"type":"media","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Sponsorship-banner-05-1M.jpg","link_url":"","columns":4,"rows":2,"subheading":"","title":"","heading_size":"h3","title_weight":false,"title_uppercase":false,"is_use_cur_heading_size":false,"cur_heading_size":28,"title_position":"justify-start items-end","header_description":"","button_label":"","is_newsletter_email":false,"is_copyed_btn":false,"newsletter_tag":"","copyed_btn_id":"","button_link":"","overlay_position":"justify-start items-end","text_alignment":"text-start","button_style":"btn btn--primary","button_color":"","button_text_color":"","tint_color":"#000000","tint_opacity":0}},"media_D